      "content": "14.1 Rail Network"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "The Rail Network forms the core infrastructure for long-distance inland passenger and cargo movement.",
        "The Road Network ensures critical feeder connectivity, linking rural areas to urban hubs and freight corridors.",
        "Airports enable high-speed regional and international mobility, supporting economic trade.",
        "Waterways and Ports offer energy-efficient bulk transport options and power international maritime trade."
      ],
      "id": "ie9hnq6"
